{"4691650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hell Girl", "steam_appid": 4691650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell has fallen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And from its fractures, sin has spilled into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become “Hellgirl,” a gun-wielding hunter, and fight your way through the corrupted realms of Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim the three sins—Wrath, Lust, and Greed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dungeon is more than a battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly traps, puzzles, and powerful enemies constantly threaten your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To endure, you must rely on precision, evasion, and sharp judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Hardcore Third-Person Horror Shooting Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat that demands quick decisions and precise control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The timing of your dodges and attacks determines your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4691650/extras/b079fc4011a774855d9b864e98884705.poster.avif?t=1779839724\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4691650/extras/b079fc4011a774855d9b864e98884705.webm?t=1779839724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4691650/extras/b079fc4011a774855d9b864e98884705.mp4?t=1779839724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4691650/extras/dd2e759cbf4a85b0dc04e3793109a003.poster.avif?t=1779839724\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4691650/extras/dd2e759cbf4a85b0dc04e3793109a003.webm?t=1779839724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4691650/extras/dd2e759cbf4a85b0dc04e3793109a003.mp4?t=1779839724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 A Fusion of Combat and Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons are not just places to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use mechanics and puzzles to carve your path forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4691650/extras/772cd0143e210f7f29fec6e900ca5288.poster.avif?t=1779839724\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4691650/extras/772cd0143e210f7f29fec6e900ca5288.webm?t=1779839724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4691650/extras/772cd0143e210f7f29fec6e900ca5288.mp4?t=1779839724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎒 Strategic Inventory System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your items and use them wisely in every situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices can change the flow of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4691650/extras/f01cda0058d271c96346291749424c7c.poster.avif?t=1779839724\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st